error[E0277]: a runtime `NativeExpand<u32>` can't change the comptime `u32`
  --> tests/error/compound_assign_runtime_into_comptime.rs:15:9
   |
15 |         word ^= perm[0];
   |         ^^^^ this binding is comptime
   |
   = help: the trait `ComptimeOperand<u32>` is not implemented for `NativeExpand<u32>`
   = note: a comptime binding is plain Rust: it changes while the kernel expands, not when it runs
   = note: make the binding runtime where it is declared, e.g. `let mut x = value.runtime();`
